[node name="Wagon" type="Node3D"]
editor_description = "The carter's wagon the porter rides in on, night 0: a two-wheeled cart and its horse, a lantern on a pole by the carter. Seats at the back for the porter and the traveller (Seat, TravellerSeat), the carter at the front (CarterSeat). Faces -Z (the horse in front). Origin on the ground under the middle of the bed. Everything but the horse is under Bed, which jolts over the road (CartJolt), so the seats and whoever sits on them jolt with it."

